<title>LATVIA: STABURADZE FURTHER UP, PRICES MIXED TO LOWER.</title>
<headline>STABURADZE FURTHER UP, PRICES MIXED TO LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staburadze maintained its upward</p>
<p>push at the reopening session of the bourse on Friday, adding</p>
<p>another santime to 2.70 lats.</p>
<p>The rest of the market was mixed to lower. Shares can be</p>
<p>bought (B) or sold (S) at the following prices and in the</p>
<p>following volume, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p> Name of Security			Last Reop_side Price Volume</p>
